  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-view qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-MhH4y2SM\" id=\"h346b9f0-MhH4y2SM\">什么是DPA？</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-CCscCp2s\">DPA（动态商品营销）是用于海量商品快速投放的工具，能够解决客户的三大痛点：海量商品投放困难、希望给每个用户展示不同的商品内容、不确定给哪些人推荐哪些商品，具体解决方案如下：</p><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-vrDwRW3c\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><ol data-id=\"o9d5df12-sT8qfE13\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-8M4HF3Qe\">通过建立商品库，把所有的商品存放进去，然后通过一个投放计划关联这个库，实现海量商品的全部投放。</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-uPdOozu4\">通过设置动态模板，提取商品库中每个商品录入的字段，投放中为每个用户推荐不同的内容，实现千人千面的创意。</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-RXBpQVoB\">用户在站内有过行为动作（包括不限于点赞、浏览、收藏等），通过将行为与商品相关联，投放中促进点击和转化。</li></ol></blockquote><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-cdc6RVrm\" id=\"h346b9f0-cdc6RVrm\">DPA使用介绍</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-61iCNkTa\">可查看 <a href=\"https://bytedance.feishu.cn/docs/doccnHTMQ2Pa4UZy9aYX9HfSRY2\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">行业产品中心介绍及使用说明</a></p><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-qdabUjFD\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-fqhYgwJR\">文档包含以下模块的介绍：</p><ol data-id=\"o9d5df12-ZPJboeB5\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-nS4wrXzA\">行业产品中心是什么？</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-jXQVTSd0\">行业产品中心能为客户解决什么问题？</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-yrN1Mmk3\">行业产品中心使用手册</li></ol></blockquote><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-GAY5zcKc\" id=\"h346b9f0-GAY5zcKc\">如何使用API投放DPA？</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-BP0U7TkP\">可查看 <a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710576532492\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">DPA投放相关接口</a>进行了解</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-zfk6p2x3\" id=\"h346b9f0-zfk6p2x3\">如何通过API实现商品管理？</h1><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-i2gSnc7x\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-LiHKlhqU\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-oO9Mf2ZS\">创建DPA计划之前，需要先创建商品库，把需要投放的商品放进去（即<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1726081113859075\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">创建DPA商品</a>）</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-3epdvBwF\">API暂未提供商品库管理的接口（可在<a href=\"https://business.oceanengine.com/site/asset/dpa/pages/library/list?cc_id=1666498217487368\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">旧版巨量引擎工作台</a>完成商品库创建、修改、删除操作），后续通过<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710577036288\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">获取商品库信息</a>查询商品库id</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-LefWWeWb\">商品的批量创建、修改、删除操作可通过API实现，API暂只支持引流电商库、通用库、电商库、其他库、小说库五种商品库的商品管理，商品管理主要通过<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1726081113859075\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">创建DPA商品</a>、<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1726081566816271\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">修改DPA商品</a>、<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1726637930114048\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">批量修改DPA商品状态</a>、<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1726629070419968\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">删除DPA商品</a>实现</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Nc2E4J5g\">可通过<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710578078732\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">获取商品列表</a>查询商品库中的商品详细信息</li></ul></blockquote><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-JjL6kgCb\" id=\"h6f20189-JjL6kgCb\"><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1726081113859075\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">创建DPA商品</span></a></h3><h4 data-id=\"hce1b53f-9Omo62jL\" id=\"hce1b53f-9Omo62jL\">请求传参</h4><p data-id=\"p838747a-99ldxe7t\">需要根据不同的商品库类型入参对应的商品详情（包括商品基础信息及落地页、品牌、商户、价格等信息）字段，不同商品库包含的字段信息存在差异</p><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t844fe7d-kRUNH8ib\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-HkQBc7O6\"><col data-id=\"c92097eb-eKjI3LG6\" span=\"1\" width=\"293%\"/><col data-id=\"c92097eb-ASl6Qi7I\" span=\"1\" width=\"293%\"/><col data-id=\"c92097eb-lJKgh4LB\" span=\"1\" width=\"293%\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-M1lDMPQL\"><tr data-id=\"t28b8a14-jIUO47Ga\" style=\"height: 100%; width: 100%;\"><td data-id=\"t54b56e0-92ENfVb0\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-RbfjOcO7\">字段</p></td><td data-id=\"t54b56e0-92ZbRijC\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-a03fDn1d\">类型</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"tfafd194-AB1eDG55\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-dGCbCX89\">描述</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t28b8a14-1eZdIAB0\" style=\"height: 100%; width: 100%;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t114fa75-MFfli3ch\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-TjJoLp2F\">product_info <span class=\"qz-tag-view qz-tag-type-must\" data-type=\"tag\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22tagType%22%3A%22must%22%2C%22tagValue%22%3A%22%E5%BF%85%E5%A1%AB%22%2C%22isCustom%22%3Afalse%2C%22id%22%3A%220eRHP%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\" style=\"color:#338aff;background:#ebf3ff;\">必填</span></p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t114fa75-WTObiGeL\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-aOcenG8k\">object</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tb2db1b9-ZgjWFi0c\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-XC957VMJ\">商品详情，包括商品基础字段、落地页、品牌、商户、价格以及其他字段信息，<span style=\"color: #e71818;\">不同类型商品库填入字段存在差异</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-UQLpuGdz\" id=\"h6f20189-UQLpuGdz\"><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1726637930114048\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">批量修改DPA商品状态</a></h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-MnvFsB2N\">可批量修改商品的投放状态，开启投放或停止投放</p><h4 data-id=\"hce1b53f-lm8XqRLz\" id=\"hce1b53f-lm8XqRLz\">请求传参</h4><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t844fe7d-KikfnI8d\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-c06A02IU\"><col data-id=\"c92097eb-gChFFF0T\" span=\"1\" width=\"293%\"/><col data-id=\"c92097eb-aWb2bZ3F\" span=\"1\" width=\"293%\"/><col data-id=\"c92097eb-FQeaVnqI\" span=\"1\" width=\"293%\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-5V0km8dl\"><tr data-id=\"t28b8a14-UE6amlBK\" style=\"height: 100%; width: 100%;\"><td data-id=\"t54b56e0-G6HbkDZ2\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-87kSAXce\">字段</p></td><td data-id=\"t54b56e0-RBkBRA2d\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-YMFC00Np\">类型</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"tfafd194-EgLR5KDJ\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-mKGMEqfS\">描述</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t28b8a14-ejDWTKjO\" style=\"height: 100%; width: 100%;\"><td data-id=\"t8b8e80e-lUAPVb56\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-BSAJHiSK\">product_ids <span class=\"qz-tag-view qz-tag-type-must\" data-type=\"tag\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22tagType%22%3A%22must%22%2C%22tagValue%22%3A%22%E5%BF%85%E5%A1%AB%22%2C%22isCustom%22%3Afalse%2C%22id%22%3A%22UOaSK%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\" style=\"color:#338aff;background:#ebf3ff;\">必填</span></p></td><td data-id=\"t8b8e80e-9lQ31eXA\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-DAXFbXeP\">number[]</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t06eb8d1-O28bVjXf\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-VsiTFGWV\">商品ID列表</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t28b8a14-UbmDhCD0\" style=\"height: 100%; width: 100%;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t114fa75-nQPLEG05\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-6A8aiju4\">opt_status <span class=\"qz-tag-view qz-tag-type-must\" data-type=\"tag\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22tagType%22%3A%22must%22%2C%22tagValue%22%3A%22%E5%BF%85%E5%A1%AB%22%2C%22isCustom%22%3Afalse%2C%22id%22%3A%221eees%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\" style=\"color:#338aff;background:#ebf3ff;\">必填</span></p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t114fa75-2cYeZGcJ\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-1yuKAYGL\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tb2db1b9-68dL1OTU\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-yimuIsSs\">操作<br/><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">ENABLE</code>开启投放<br/><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">DISABLE</code>停止投放</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-EFMAxTOv\"><br/></p></div>",
